## The top

::bg{location="summit" time="dawn"}
::music{playback="change" mood="elegy" volume="normal"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The Warden does not fall so much as come undone — a coat of ash with nobody inside it, folding onto the top step.
@narrator{code="0020"}: Past it: a door with no lock, and grey light under the door.
::actor{character="sable" anchor="right" action="fadeInUp"}
@sable{code="0010" emotion="stricken"}: I watched it take me. Forty years I've watched it take everyone. I wanted to see it once from this side.
::assert{saw(sable, wardenFall)}
::set{user.bond.sable += 1}
@sable{code="0020" emotion="fond" when="run.carriesFeather"}: You brought my feather up here. Of course you did.
::actor{character="sable" action="fadeOut"}
